OL,3,GHighlands & Eilean Siar
OL,4,
OL,5,CThis Evening and Tonight:FBright
OL,6,Fspells and a few showers this evening,
OL,7,Fthe showers predominately affecting
OL,8,Fparts of Caithness and Sutherland.
OL,9,FTurning mainly dry through the rest of
OL,10,Fthe night with some clear spells.
OL,11,
OL,12,CMonday:FEarly showers across Caithness
OL,13,Fand Sutherland will clear, leaving a
OL,14,Fbright day with plenty of sunny
OL,15,Fspells. Sunshine will turn a little
OL,16,Fhazy at times through the afternoon.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,24,ANext Page  BWeather  CReg News  FReg TV
