OL,4,
OL,5,COutlook for Tuesday to Thursday:FMostly
OL,6,Fdry Tuesday. Changeable and breezy
OL,7,FWednesday and Thursday with variable
OL,8,Fcloud and showery outbreaks of rain.
OL,9,FBest conditions in the east where it
OL,10,Fwill become warm or very warm.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
